<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SA Bias says may delist from JSE in Q3.</title>
<headline>SA Bias says may delist from JSE in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SA Bias Industries Ltd said on Monday that discussions were in progress that could result in the delisting of the firm from the Johannesburg Stock Exchange in the third quarter of this year.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings until a further announcement was made which was expected towards the end of this month.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
